      "final": "Renamed `Tips.ProviderConfig.mode/0` to `provider_mode/0` across the application caller, tests, test helper, and documentation. There is no compatibility alias; the runtime configuration key remains `:mode`.\n\nThe updated acceptance test first failed with `UndefinedFunctionError` for the new name. After the rename, formatting, warnings-as-errors compilation, strict Credo, and the documentation check passed. The targeted tests passed (26 passed, 1 excluded), as did the full non-browser suite (508 passed, 4 excluded).\n\nAutomatic compiler feedback initially said compilation was pending, then LSP references resolved and diagnostics returned no messages. The pending response caused a brief retry; it did not identify an error. I saw no feedback receipt."
